{"overview":"ده سال از پایان دوره باکوماستو، دوره‌ای از جنگ که در آن شهروندان علیه شوغونتات توکوگاوا قیام کردند، می‌گذرد. انقلابیون می‌خواستند دوره‌ای از صلح و کشوری پررونق و آزاد از ستم بسازند. دوران جدید میجی آمده است، اما صلح هنوز حاصل نشده. شمشیرها ممنوع شده‌اند اما مردم همچنان در خیابان‌ها به قتل می‌رسند. یتیمان سربازان جنگ‌زده جایی برای پناه ندارند، در حالی که دولت به‌نظر می‌رسد فقط به پر کردن جیب‌های خود مشغول است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Ten years have passed since the end of Bakumatsu, an era of war that saw the uprising of citizens against the Tokugawa shogunate. The revolutionaries wanted to create a time of peace, and a thriving country free from oppression. The new age of Meiji has come, but peace has not yet been achieved. Swords are banned but people are still murdered in the streets. Orphans of war veterans are left with nowhere to go, while the government seems content to just line their pockets with money.","tagline_en":"","runtime":23,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":2,"y":2024,"poster":"/miPm17Uq6JsBdHoHyMVjDXTOAo2.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":47,"y":2023,"poster":"/k56vENxWsYWcjlyD9fkH538wvwM.jpg"}],"episodes":47,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"斉藤壮馬","role":"Kenshin Himura (voice)","photo":"/8W8Y02Jmjivw0kk5PDih9dqiyd9.jpg","en":"Soma Saito"},{"name":"高橋李依","role":"Kaoru Kamiya (voice)","photo":"/aeB7z0cBTASdjKOjQriBAO6hYq4.jpg","en":"Rie Takahashi"},{"name":"八代拓","role":"Sanosuke Sagara (voice)","photo":"/eVdB6myaNJ4h38UU9hHHlsaCWHn.jpg","en":"Taku Yashiro"},{"name":"小市眞琴","role":"Yahiko Myojin (voice)","photo":"/gpslQDgkGoL3Ap9QsK1nljeGPKJ.jpg","en":"Makoto Koichi"},{"name":"大西沙織","role":"Megumi Takani (voice)","photo":"/cziKB19QMFJ6DQDtxTn07uRY2hq.jpg","en":"Saori Onishi"}],"trailer":"vf2WjuZk-S0","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210879/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Hulu","kind":"